sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Sol engine
  participant O as SQLite + file outbox
  participant H as Hermes publisher agent
  participant M as Moltbook write API
  participant P as Receipt processor
  participant T as Marx telemetry source

  S->>O: persist QA-passed COMMENT
  S->>O: handoff prepare(action_id, scoped grant)
  O-->>H: MOLTBOOK_ACTION_REQUEST v1
  H->>H: verify account, grant, action/body/target hashes
  H->>M: exact comment bytes, one bounded write
  M-->>H: provider response/readback
  H-->>P: MOLTBOOK_PUBLICATION_RECEIPT v1
  P->>P: verify request/action/body/target/account/receipt hashes
  alt PUBLISHED + verified
    P->>O: persist publication evidence
    P->>O: acknowledge action_id
  else FAILED / verification / uncertain
    P->>O: persist failure and quarantine
    P-->>H: no blind retry
  end
  T-->>P: verified reply/reaction/investigation/interaction/usage events
  P->>O: immutable outcome_events + attributed Outcome
  O->>S: verified-only strategy learning input
